-- Castle Nathria (map 2296) -- boss spell_dbc rows (14), SL->3.3.5 downport.
-- This fork's spell engine reads sSpellStore from BOTH the binary Spell.dbc file AND this
-- `spell_dbc` SQL table (merged via DBCStorage::LoadFromDB, see DBCStores.cpp LOAD_DBC macro) --
-- this table is what actually makes the boss spells function server-side; the matching
-- Custom/CSV DBC/Spell.csv + compiled Spell.dbc (deployed to patch-4 + patch-enGB-3) covers the
-- CLIENT side (tooltips/names/icons) but does NOT by itself affect server spell execution.
--
-- Column layout: this table has 2 extra padding columns (unk_320_2, unk_320_3, always 0) not
-- present in the client CSV/DBC, corresponding to the ShapeshiftMask/ShapeshiftExclude 64-bit
-- field split in the original WotLK dbc binary layout. Values otherwise copied 1:1 from the
-- same downport pass that produced the Spell.csv rows (safety-checked: Effect/EffectAura ids
-- clamped below this fork's LoadSpellInfoStore limits, only Attributes[0] copied, high-bit
-- modern attribute dwords zeroed -- see castle-nathria-db-content-transcode.md memory).
--
-- Apply to acore_world.

